Strike an adjacent target with a mighty blow from the forge, inflicting [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.  If the attack hits, the echo of the attack will lash out at all enemies in a [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] radius of the impact.

Learning this talent adds [14, 19, 23, 26, 29 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage and [14, 19, 23, 26, 29 (TL1-5; MP 100)] burning damage to your Dream Hammer strikes.

The mind and fire damage will scale with your Mindpower.
